  "street_name": "TYSSEN ROAD",
  "decision_date": "07/11/2025",
  "date_building_work_completed_under_previous_permission": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed communal courtyard hereby permitted shall not be used by patrons of the use of the site except in an emergency or to carry out maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In the interest of neighbour noise and amenity.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The windows onto the internal courtyard shall be&amp;nbsp;non-openable to prevent noise transmission from inside.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In the interest of neighbour noise and amenity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed windows in the eastern and western side elevations at first floor level shall be obscure glazed. The first floor window on eastern side elevation shall be obscure glazed and non opening below 1.7m of the internal floor ceiling height.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\nREASON: In the interest of neighbour privacy&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre; white-space: normal;&quot;&gt;\t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;All new external finishes in respect of all the works hereby approved (and any other incidental works to be carried out in this connection) shall match the existing building in respect of materials used, detailed execution and finished appearance, unless otherwise stated on the drawings hereby approved.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure that the external appearance of the building is satisfactory and does not detract from the character and visual amenity of the area.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
